            </note>
            <note corresp="#d131-f3" n="3" xml:id="d131-f3-content">
                <p><ref target="#d129">Document 129</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d131-f4" n="4" xml:id="d131-f4-content">
                <p>In telegram 1117 to Saigon, the Department of State also noted that, during his
                    current visit to Washington, Ambassador Buu
                        Hoi had expressed the idea that the Diem government should appoint a cabinet level official
                    responsible for religious affairs. Buu Hoi
                    suggested that Ambassador Nolting might
                    take up the idea with Diem.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
